:= []byte{0xDE, 0xAD, 0xBE, 0xEF}\n\tfmt.Printf(\"Processing packet bytes: % x\\n\", payload)\n\t// Panic occurs here when packet length < header size\n}\n```\n\n### Shell reproducer\n```bash\ncurl -sSL https://api.example.com/v1/packets | ./decoder --strict --verbose\n```\n\n### Expected Configuration\n```json\n{\n  \"strict_mode\": true,\n  \"max_packet_bytes\": 1400,\n  \"fallback_strategy\": \"drop\"\n}\n```\n\nFixes #12 and resolves mas-bandwidth/work-test#4.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mas-bandwidth/work-test/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mas-bandwidth/work-test/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}]